SUMMARY:WNC Bigfoot Festival
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nDo you believe? Let's go celebra
 te the world's most elusive celebrity. Expect food trucks\, vendors\, live
  music\, oddities\, cryptid enthusiasts\, and an unlikely\, but still incr
 eased chance of an actual Bigfoot sighting.\n\nThis is in Marion\, NC whic
 h is about an hour from Asheville. It is an outdoor event\, so sunscreen o
 r umbrellas depending on the weather.\n\nCheck this website for more info 
 and to get an idea about parking:\n\n[WNC Bigfoot Festival ](https://mario
 nbigfootfestival.wordpress.com/)\n\nAnyone open to or interested in car-po
 oling\, message me and we can coordinate.\n\nLet's plan to meet in front o
 f the Post Office on Main St. between 11-11:30a and explore from there.
